# Business Requirements

Core question: how can the marketplace improve revenue, delivery performance,
customer satisfaction and seller quality using trusted analytics and AI?

| ID | Business question | Page | Metrics |
|---|---|---|---|
| BQ1 | Which categories and regions drive revenue, and is growth on target? | Executive, Sales | Revenue, orders, AOV, target attainment |
| BQ2 | Why do review scores change, and how much is explained by delivery? | Logistics, AI Insights | Avg review, late rate, delay days |
| BQ3 | Which sellers carry the most operational risk? | Sellers | Seller risk score, late rate, cancellations |
| BQ4 | Which customers are valuable or at risk, and do they come back? | Customers | RFM, repeat rate, cohort retention |
| BQ5 | What changed this month and what should management do? | AI Insights | Anomalies, recommendations, approval status |

Analysis window: Jan 2017 to Aug 2018 (earlier and later months are sparse).
Currency: Brazilian real (BRL). Targets are illustrative, not real company targets.